Package: byteguru-wincompat
Source: byteguru
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ByteguruOS Team <devel@byteguru.example>
Installed-Size: 122
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), apparmor, apparmor-utils, wine64 | wine, winetricks, ca-certificates
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: WinCompat subsystem for running Windows applications
 WCV manifest validation, per-application prefixes with rollback, drive letter
 and path visibility filter, AppArmor/seccomp policy generation, coverage
 registry where a level is only published from recorded runs. This is an
 optional component: nothing else in the system imports it at runtime, and
 bgd treats its absence as "no Windows applications available".
